# ── Routeway — base: https://api.routeway.ai/v1 · get a key: https://routeway.ai/dashboard/keys
export ROUTEWAY_API_KEY=""
#    note: all six are priced 0 and marked available in the catalog the probe reads (2026-09-02), and only the :free suffix is zero-priced — the same catalog meters Claude and GPT at list rates. deepseek-v4-flash, kimi-k2.6 and minimax-m2.7 were created on 2026-08-31 with a 42,000-token context on the free lane, and like muse-glimmer-30b (arrived 2026-08-28) they stay out of the Models column until they have stood a while: every family in that column is a tripwire the api-models probe re-checks on every run

# ── SambaNova Cloud — base: https://api.sambanova.ai/v1 · get a key: https://cloud.sambanova.ai/apis
export SAMBANOVA_CLOUD_API_KEY=""
#    note: model ids are case-sensitive; the catalog publishes list prices for every row, so the free tier is a quota rather than a zero-priced lane

# ── Vercel AI Gateway — base: https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1 · get a key: https://vercel.com/dashboard/ai-gateway/api-keys
export VERCEL_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=""
#    note: every id listed is priced 0 in and 0 out and draws nothing from the $5 credit; any other Free-Tier-eligible model spends it. One such id on 2026-08-20, five on 2026-09-02: MiniMax M3 (Free) and M2.7 (Free) arrived beside metered twins at $0.30/$1.20 per 1M, and Ling 3.0 Flash Fin is priced 0 with and without its -free suffix. They stay out of the Models column until they have stood a while — zai/glm-4.6v-flash was free here from 2026-08-14 and gone by 2026-08-20. spacexai/grok-stt, the sixth zero row, is ignored on purpose: speech-to-text, billed at $0.000028 per second of audio in the same row

# ── Hetzner Inference API — base: https://inference.hetzner.com/api/v1 · get a key: https://experiments.hetzner.com/inference
export HETZNER_INFERENCE_API_KEY=""
#    note: both ids are 262K-context and take text and images; /v1/models, /v1/completions and /v1/chat/completions are the whole surface. The key is minted in the Inference tab of experiments.hetzner.com, which is a client-rendered page behind a Hetzner login — the readable copy of the terms is the docs page this row probes

# ── Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope, international) — base: https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1 · get a key: https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com
